Explanation and Work Process
	The original privacy statement is extremely vague. I changed the Data we collect part to explain what type of data is collected and what is being done with the data. I did this because I felt that it was important for individuals to understand what exactly was being done. The next section on how we collect data was missing a lot of details. I changed this to explain in more detail how we collect data. I did this so that individuals who don’t want certain data collected about them can avoid this or at least understand why it is important for us to collect it.
